ATTRIBUTION
-----------

Recognition engine and model:

  Tilawa (formerly offline-tarteel)
  https://github.com/yazinsai/tilawa
  MIT License, Copyright (c) yazinsai.

  The bundled acoustic model (fastconformer_full_mixed.onnx) and the Quran
  CTC token tables (vocab.json, quran.json, quran_ctc_tokens.json) are
  downloaded from the Tilawa v0.2.0 release and are covered by the MIT License.

Concept:

  The feature set was derived by reverse-engineering the public Tarteel app
  (com.mmmoussa.iqra) solely to understand its behavior and data shapes. This
  project does NOT contain any Tarteel code, the Tarteel cloud model, any
  proprietary Tarteel databases, or the "Tarteel" name or branding. "Iqra" is a
  generic Quranic term and carries no trademark. The reverse-engineering report
  is kept for transparency in docs/REVERSE_ENGINEERING.md.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Tarteel or
any reciter.


